    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>奇物，珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這把銀色的萬能鑰匙摸起來很溫暖。若你持握着鑰匙形態的它，你便可以用一個動作從鑰匙中施展法術<em> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.VC9nFuUxF7yptXK5]{敲擊術 Knock}</em>。<br /><em><strong>轉化鑰匙Transforming the Key。</strong> </em>持握鑰匙期間，你可以用一個附贈動作將其轉變爲一把魔法長劍。你熟練於這把劍，並且你用它進行的攻擊檢定和傷害擲骰獲得+1加值。命中目標時，劍會造成[[/damage 1d10 type=force]]傷害。該物品的劍形態持續到你不再持握它或者你用一個附贈動作將其恢復到鑰匙形態爲止。如果你在該物品處於劍形態時結束對該物品的同調，它會自動恢復到鑰匙形態。</p><p>This silver skeleton key is warm to the touch. While holding the key in its key form, you can use an action to cast the @spell[Knock] spell from the key.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Transforming the Key\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Transforming the Key.</span> While holding the key, you can use a bonus action to transform it into a magic longsword. You are considered proficient with the sword, and you have a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it. On a hit, the sword deals [[/damage 1d10 type=force]] damage. The item remains in its sword form until it leaves your grasp or you use another bonus action to revert it to its key form.</p><p>If you end your attunement to the item while it's in its sword form, it automatically reverts to its key form.</p></div></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
